        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Victoria, Edward VII\n- Dynasties: House of Hanover, House of Saxe-Coburg and Gotha\n- Places: Britain, Saxe-Coburg and Gotha\n- Topics: royal succession, German dynasties\n\nFacts:\n- Upon Victoria's death, the British throne passed to her eldest son Edward VII.\n- Edward VII belonged through his father to the House of Saxe-Coburg and Gotha.\n- The House of Saxe-Coburg and Gotha is a German dynasty.\n- The House of Saxe-Coburg and Gotha ruled the duchy of Saxe-Coburg and Gotha.\n- The duchy of Saxe-Coburg and Gotha was one of the Ernestine duchies.",
